      "questionText": "設空間向量 $\\tilde{a} = (3, -2, 1)$、$\\tilde{b} = (2, 1, -3)$，求兩向量的夾角 $\\theta$。",
      "answerText": "($\\tilde{a} \\bullet \\tilde{b}$) = $3 \\times 2 + (-2) \\times 1 + 1 \\times (-3)$ = $6 - 2 - 3$ = $1$，$|\\tilde{a}| = \\frac{\\text{sqrt}(3^2 + (-2)^2 + 1^2)}{1}$ = $\\text{sqrt}(14)$，$|\\tilde{b}| = \\frac{\\text{sqrt}(2^2 + 1^2 + (-3)^2)}{1}$ = $\\text{sqrt}(14)$，故 $\\text{cos} \\theta = \\frac{1}{\\text{sqrt}(14) \\times \\text{sqrt}(14)}$ = $\\frac{1}{14}$，$\\theta = \\text{acos}(\\frac{1}{14})$。",
